      "message": "test(ui): regenerate the snapshot goldens for 0.18.0\n\nThe three shell goldens (dark, light, tool editor) follow the UI changes\nmerged since v0.17.0: the ribbon polish (#767), capitalised tab titles and\nthe removed status-bar tail. Regenerated once at the cut, as AGENTS.md\n\"Pixel snapshots are release-lane\" says. The maintainer accepted them for\nthis cut without the usual manual look at the diff images (2026-11-12);\nthe gpu_render docs snapshot was unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
